|| Tutorial                                                    || Description                                               || Covered
*--------------------------------------------------------------+------------------------------------------------------------+------------------------------+
| {{{./native/native-core/StaticContentHttpServer/index.html}Static Content}} | Serve SPA assets (HTML, CSS, JavaScript) from the <<<PUBLIC/>>> classpath directory alongside REST endpoints. | /PUBLIC
*--------------------------------------------------------------+------------------------------------------------------------+------------------------------+


* Polyglot

  Write individual procedures in any JVM language.  Each procedure in a REST YAML flow can be
  implemented in a different language; OfficeFloor injects dependencies and executes them together
  in one pipeline.

*--------------------------------------------------------------+------------------------------------------------------------+------------------------------+
|| Tutorial                                                    || Description                                               || Covered
*--------------------------------------------------------------+------------------------------------------------------------+------------------------------+
| {{{./features/features-polyglot/ScalaHttpServer/index.html}Scala}}    | Implement native OfficeFloor procedure logic in Scala. | Polyglot Scala\
|                                                              |                                                            | Scala Procedure
*--------------------------------------------------------------+------------------------------------------------------------+------------------------------+
| {{{./features/features-polyglot/JavaScriptHttpServer/index.html}JavaScript}} | Implement native OfficeFloor procedure logic in JavaScript via GraalVM. | Polyglot JavaScript\
|                                                              |                                                            | GraalVM
*--------------------------------------------------------------+------------------------------------------------------------+------------------------------+
| {{{./features/features-polyglot/CatsHttpServer/index.html}Cats Effect}} | Integrate Cats Effect functional IO into native OfficeFloor REST composition. | {{{https://typelevel.org/cats-effect/}Cats Effect}}
*--------------------------------------------------------------+------------------------------------------------------------+------------------------------+
| {{{./features/features-polyglot/ZioHttpServer/index.html}ZIO}}        | Integrate ZIO functional effects into native OfficeFloor REST composition. | {{{https://zio.dev}ZIO}}
*--------------------------------------------------------------+------------------------------------------------------------+------------------------------+


